    <briefdescription>
<para>An implementation of <emphasis><ref refid="structllvm_1_1mca_1_1_source_mgr" kindref="compound">SourceMgr</ref></emphasis> that allows users to add new instructions incrementally / dynamically. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Note that this <ref refid="structllvm_1_1mca_1_1_source_mgr" kindref="compound">SourceMgr</ref> takes ownership of all <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1mca_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">mca::Instruction</ref></emphasis>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
